e something like this  he's the only one that won't blow it out  on the stem he can make a circle better  than anybody I've ever seen and any he  has a way of making your idea better  than what it was  the celestial geometric lines and super  angular spherical compositions those are  kind of my thing fine line black and  gray single you know  it's a style that's been around for a  long time my mentor championed it it's  not something that I invented I think  maybe it's something I just introduced  to a broader audience with my own style  version of it his technique is much more  discrete  he creates vignettes of exceptional  detail in such microscopic versions it  blows my mind the artistic creativity  and abilities and he does it with such a  gentle hand you can tell that it's him  immediately dr. Wu is one of the best  tattoo artists  [Music]  I would became a fan of receiving  tattoos  I loved up the art and the designs that  other tattooers were making I was in  variant design and drawing but never in  a tattoo aesthetic direction I was too  intimidated when I was younger to think  that I could ever become a tattoo artist  [Music]  when I started getting heavily into  collecting tattoos and hanging out with  Mark Mahoney and the people at shamrock  I was already in my early 20s I got a  little Saturn behind my ear  nothing I I saw dr. Wu's Saturn on his  ear and I was like oh that looks awesome  I'd like one like that so most of my  tattoos are not symbolically important  but they're really beautiful  spur the moment most of my other tattoos  have been sort of the standard parlor  experience and the Hideaway experience  is definitely something that's special  and unique it's not just getting the  tattoo but it's really designing it what  dr. Luu hideaway is my first studio that  I opened up outside of leaving shamrock  and it was kind of my den I guess and  the idea was just I can do my work there  and have lines be comfortable and  friends come through and hang